the way to the World Tree.

251
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:04,920
That's pretty cool.

252
00:19:08,220 --> 00:19:11,900
Hey Kirito dance with me, huh dance.

253
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:13,668
It's an advanced technique.

254
00:19:13,800 --> 00:19:17,840
I just mastered you just hover
then slowly spin on your x-axis

255
